<title>NEW ZEALAND: S&amp;P rates NZ's Watercare Services Ltd A+/A-1.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates NZ's Watercare Services Ltd A+/A-1.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit ratings agency Standard and Poor's said on Thursday it had assigned its A+ long term and A-1 short term credit ratings to New Zealand's Watercare Services Ltd.</p>
<p>It said the rating outlook was stable.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the ratings reflected Watercare's strategic importance as a leading water and wastewater wholesaler in the Auckland region, its solid customer base and robust demand growth.</p>
<p>Watercare's largest customer is Auckland City Council.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
